  "sourceTitle": "Spicy Deviled Eggs",
  "sourceText": "Spicy Deviled Eggs\nBy: Melissa Peterman\nPublished: Friday, December 18, 2009 - 11:46pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n6 hard cooked eggs\n1/4 cup mayonnaise\n2 tablespoons finely chopped green onion\n1 teaspoon mustard\n1/2 teaspoon hot pepper sauce\n1/8 teaspoon salt\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Prep 25 Min. 2 Cut eggs in half. Remove yolks; mash. Blend in remaining ingredients. Refill whites. 3 Makes 1 dozen.",
